  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daycount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1233297?logo=curseforge&logoColor=black&label=&labelColor=orange&color=242424\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdaycount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/daycount?style=flat&logo=modrinth&logoColor=black&label=&labelColor=18ED49&color=242424\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daycount\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1233297(4F21AC).svg\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rSVp3nCpPx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1388544059114786907?style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=blue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D71EVQVC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-75D5E3?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></a></p>\n<h2>天數統計 (Forge / NeoForge / Fabric)</h2>\n<p>一款輕量級的 HUD，用於顯示您在 Minecraft 世界中已經過的天數。非常適合用於「100 天」挑戰或追蹤長期生存進度。</p>\n<h3>功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>位置調整：</strong>可調整 X 和 Y 座標，將計數器放置於畫面任意位置。</li>\n<li><strong>外觀設定：</strong>支援自訂文字顏色與縮放比例。</li>\n<li><strong>自訂文字：</strong>「Day: 」前綴可替換為任何字串。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>設定檔：</h3>\n<p>設定檔位於您的 <code>/config</code> 資料夾中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Forge / NeoForge：</strong> <code>daycount-client.toml</code></li>\n<li><strong>Fabric：</strong> <code>daycount.json5</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1233297/description_62d1de14-7366-497a-a585-a44452c05111.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>背景框（含透明度）功能於 1.5.0 及更新版本中加入：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1233297/description_15e6a013-c071-4c2f-925b-7a4e1d0a20a2.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"371\"></p>",
